    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so permanent. like there is no way to undo what happened and there is no path back to being \"normal\" again. i look at everyone else hanging out and it’s like i'm watching a movie of a life i don't even belong to anymore. it’s just a constant ache. i'm so tired of feeling like this.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
